<title>KUWAIT: Al-Ahli Bank '96 net up, no dividends.</title>
<headline>Al-Ahli Bank '96 net up, no dividends.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net profits at Al-Ahli Bank of Kuwait rose 45.8 percent to 6.3 million dinars ($20.8 million) but no dividend will be paid, a bank official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Deposits fell to 895 million dinars from 908 million in 1995 while loans rose to 337 million dinars compared to 267 million.</p>
<p>Detailed figures will be released &quot;soon&quot;, said the official.</p>
<p>($1=0.302 dinar)</p>
</text>
